---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Fable" description="How the Fable marketing site and waitlist handle personal information.">
  <article class="content-page legal-page">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <p class="page-label">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This policy covers the Fable marketing site and waitlist. It does not describe the local data stored by the Fable desktop app.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="draft-banner" role="note">
      <strong>Draft — legal review required</strong>
      <span>Version 2026-07-03-v0.1 · Effective date pending</span>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-layout">
      <aside class="legal-meta" aria-label="Policy details">
        <p><strong>Controller</strong>[CONTROLLER_LEGAL_NAME]</p>
        <p><strong>Address</strong>[CONTROLLER_ADDRESS]</p>
        <p><strong>Contact</strong>[PRIVACY_CONTACT_EMAIL]</p>
      </aside>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            Fable is an open-source, local-first AI workspace. This policy explains how we handle personal information when you visit this website or join the product waitlist.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>What this policy covers</h2>
          <p>
            This policy applies to the public marketing website and waitlist signup flow. It does not cover your local workspace, files, API keys, connectors, or other on-device data in the Fable desktop app.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>Information we collect</h2>
          <h3>Information you provide</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Your email address when you join the waitlist.</li>
            <li>Information you send when you contact us.</li>
            <li>Your explicit consent to receive waitlist and product updates.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Server and security logs needed to operate and protect the site, such as request timestamps, user agent, IP address, and error diagnostics.</li>
            <li>Cookie or analytics information only where enabled and permitted.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We do not ask waitlist visitors for passwords, payment details, government identification, or access to a Fable desktop workspace.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>How we use information</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>Operate and secure the marketing site.</li>
            <li>Record and manage waitlist signups.</li>
            <li>Send updates you have agreed to receive.</li>
            <li>Measure basic site performance and fix errors.</li>
            <li>Respond to privacy and support requests.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Waitlist data is not used to access your local Fable workspace.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>Legal basis and retention</h2>
          <p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> [LAWFUL_BASIS_WAITLIST] — owner or legal counsel must confirm this before publication.</p>
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr><th>Data</th><th>Retention</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Waitlist records</td><td>[RETENTION_WAITLIST]</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Server and security logs</td><td>[RETENTION_LOGS]</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Cookie or analytics data</td><td>As stated when those tools are enabled</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>Sharing and international transfers</h2>
          <p>
            We may use service providers to host the site, operate the waitlist, send email, and run analytics if enabled. A current list will be published at [SUBPROCESSOR_LIST].
          </p>
          <p>We do not sell personal information as part of the waitlist flow.</p>
          <p>If information is processed outside your country, the transfer mechanism is [TRANSFER_MECHANISM].</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
          <p>
            Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or restrict the use of your information, and to withdraw consent where processing is consent-based.
          </p>
          <p>To make a request, email [PRIVACY_CONTACT_EMAIL]. If you are not satisfied with our response, you may contact [COMPLAINT_AUTHORITY].</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-section">
          <h2>Children and policy changes</h2>
          <p>The site and waitlist are intended for people aged [MINIMUM_AGE] and older. We do not knowingly collect information from children below that age.</p>
          <p>We will update this policy when our practices change and publish a revised effective date.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
